Purpose: Strip symbol and debug data from the native libraries embedded in the shipped binaries (Plan 0007). The build script strips each target's libopentui.so from the OpenTUI platform package immediately before that target's bundle step, and strips the staged librust_pty_arm64.so in --android mode. The strip tool resolves as $OPENICK_STRIP, then llvm-strip, then strip; a missing tool or a failed strip aborts the build. The compiled binary itself is never stripped.
Upstream files: packages/opencode/script/build.ts
Rebase note: The step anchors on the targets loop and the --android staging block, both already touched by patches 0001 and 0003. If upstream renames the platform packages or restructures the loop, re-anchor the stripNative and opentuiLibPath helpers beside the bundle step; the invariant is that every embedded libopentui.so is stripped exactly once before bundling.

